<title>USA: Wall Street stocks lower at start.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks lower at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Streets stocks were mostly lower with bonds after the Dow industrials scored two record closing highs in as many days.</p>
<p>--Dow Industrials off seven at 7218.</p>
<p>--Nasdaq Composite off seven at 1321.</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index off one at 827.</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline 236/282</p>
<p>--Nasdaq advance/decline 699/648</p>
<p>--The 30-year long bond off 10/32 to yield 6.92 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737</p>
</text>
